  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan summons Tai Bai Yun Sheng and asks how his cultivation has been. Tai Bai Yun Sheng reports repairing Lang Ya cloud soil and rivers for immortal essence stones, buying nine cloud ring and float ball tea seeds, and planning jade hummingbirds once the tea matures. Fang Yuan notes that Landscape as Before will make him welcome wherever he goes.",
      "chapters": [
        672
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "prior-life-opportunity",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_tai_bai_yun_sheng",
        "fac_lang_ya_sect",
        "move_landscape_as_before"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Paradise Earth Immortal Venerable subdued the blue dragon whale, awakened its immortal aperture, and left a Paradise Earth true inheritance in that grotto-heaven.",
      "chapters": [
        1651
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "beast-and-aperture",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_paradise_earth_immortal_venerable",
        "inh_paradise_earth_true_inheritance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He also helped enlighten many legendary immemorial beasts, including this one.",
      "chapters": [
        2047
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "beast-and-aperture",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lu Wei Yin states that Eastern Sea’s Paradise Earth true inheritance is in the blue dragon whale.",
      "chapters": [
        2087
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "beast-and-aperture",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lu_wei_yin",
        "reg_eastern_sea"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan later treats it as a legendary immemorial desolate beast whose strength sits near the world’s pinnacle.",
      "chapters": [
        1915
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "beast-and-aperture",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gu Immortals who explore its paradise never see the whale initiate contact, and when it appears, vanishes, or moves stays unknown to them.",
      "chapters": [
        1916
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "beast-and-aperture",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After he leaves, he cannot find its traces again, and heaven and earth travel into its immortal aperture fails each time.",
      "chapters": [
        2142
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
